		{"vo", ch="sen01", path=":vo/001/", file="sen010103730"},
		{"text"},
		line=920,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"vo", ch="sen11", path=":vo/011/", file="sen110103730"},
		{"text"},
		line=925,
	},
	{
		{"fg", id=1, path=":fg/001/", file="bz01302", face="tat_z0101103", x=0},
		{"mwf", path=":fa/001/", file="fac_0102103"},
		{"vo", ch="sen01", path=":vo/001/", file="sen010103740"},
		{"text"},
		line=930,
	},
	{
		{"fg", mode=-1, id=1, lv=""},
		{"mwf"},
		{"text"},
		line=936,
	},
	{
		{"text"},
		line=937,
	},
	{
		{"text"},
		line=938,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010020b"},
		line=938,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Morning classes end, and it's now time for lunch.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"We arrive at the cafeteria in our usual group of three, plus Akari.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"This place makes use of a Republican serving method called a ≪buffet.≫",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"It was hard to get used to at first, but it's a marvelous system where you can eat as much as you want of anything you want.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"And yet, the dishes on display are strictly divided between Imperials and Republicans.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"The dishes for Imperials contain lots of vegetables and are frankly rather stingy.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"The dishes for Republicans are the complete opposite.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"And there's a tacit understanding that Imperials are forbidden to eat Republican dishes.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hotori, you gotta eat more if you wanna grow big.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's customary for warriors to eat simply.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"One of the three tenets of all warriors is “Simplicity and frugality in all things.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"As the head of the Three Founders, House Inou strictly abides by these teachings.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"By contrast, Shino's plate is loaded with fried chicken, Hamburg steak, and deep-fried potatoes.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Shino always eats dishes from both countries without reservation, her excuse being “I'm mixed.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You eat too much fat.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Fried is justice! With no fat, there can be no victory.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Y'know why we lost to the Republic? We didn't eat enough fat.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I hope it goes straight to your gut.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Sorry, kiddo, but I don't get fat.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"She makes a show of putting her hands on her thin hips.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Next to Shino espousing her doctrine of fried supremacy, Akari eats her meal in silence.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"This heir apparent to the Imperial throne, for what little it's worth, is eating─",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mixed ankake yakisoba.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"She shoots me an awkward look.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Akari's table manners are as refined as you'd expect, gracefully taking her meal with elegant movements.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"She dispassionately continues with her meal until eventually, all that remains on her plate is a single quail egg.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Miyaguni, you shouldn't be picky about what you eat.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Shino deftly swipes the lone quail egg.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah... huh?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Om nom nom... Mmm, scrumptious.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Good job laying that thing with that small body of yours. Thank ye muchly, oh quail.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Akari's chopsticks slip out of her hand.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I was saving that egg...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I was saving the best for last!”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“L-Looks like I screwed up.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Don't worry, it's all-you-can-eat. I'll get you another one.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't want seconds.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“One egg per person. That's the very foundation of yakisoba!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I-Is that how it is?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That is how it is.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Y-Yes, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Overwhelmed by Akari's glare, Shino sits a little straighter.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You might be the head of your conglomerate, but I'm not gonna take this from you!”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Sure enough, the words of someone who tried to assassinate the chancellor carry some weight.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm sorry. I was just trying to act cool.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As long as you understand...”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Akari grumbles, barely managing to stifle her frustration.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You sure get hung up over the strangest things.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I don't wanna hear it from someone who picks his tofu based on where the soybeans were grown.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's more common than you think.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's totally not.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Hotori declares coolly.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"The people around us begin stirring up a commotion.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"I look up, and the president is walking straight towards us, tray in hand.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"I marvel at the rare sight, but at the same time, I've got a bad feeling about this.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hello. Could I have a bit of your time?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Heya, Elsa. Salutations.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Salutations.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"The two exchange a standard Republican greeting.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'd like to speak with Miyaguni-san. Is that quite all right?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"When Akari silently gestures toward an empty seat, the president takes her food and sits down.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Her tray is lined with meat, fried foods, and other sorts of hearty dishes.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Glad to see the people of the Empire always eat healthy.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It helps keep us from getting fat.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh my, could you be referring to me?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course not.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Right, that goes without saying.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"The president gives me a sweet smile.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-san, thank you for your fascinating opinions in class this morning.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There are so few Imperials who speak their mind, so I was very pleased to hear from you.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Glad to hear I lived up to your expectations.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You said today is your first day back in school, but whereabouts might you live?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You know a flower shop called Koujiya Flowers?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yes, of course. What was that area it's in again?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Without breaking her smile, the president continues questioning Akari.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nando District.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, but of course!”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"The president affectedly claps her hands.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If I remember correctly, you moved away two years ago, right?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Where might you have lived before you moved to Nando District?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"The president continues her inquisition, casually eating fried chicken all the while.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Seems like she's already looked into Akari's personal history in such a short time.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Akari's personal history is, of course, entirely fake.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"She even has a false family register, so as not to arouse suspicion when investigated.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"But it's another matter entirely whether, when it comes down to it, she has everything memorized.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Shirogane District. Second block, I think it was.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Say, what are you playing at with this interrogation game?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Whatever do you think?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I haven't the faintest idea.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehee. Try searching your own cart for the answer.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Heart.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Shino quickly corrects her.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Right, heart.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"The president smiles, not the least bit ruffled.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Come to think of it, your job is to dig into people's backgrounds, isn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's just a tool of the trade. My job is to keep the order here in Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm the reason you all can live in peace.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm an upstanding citizen, I'll have you know.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If that's the truth, then nothing could make me happier.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"The president smiles faintly.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Those questions were just a bit of a lesson for our newest transfer student.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We'd appreciate it if you didn't do anything to make us suspicious of you.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Like, say, fraternizing with well-known warriors on your very first day.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"The president directs a meaningful glance at me and Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anyone suspicious is punished without mercy.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't believe there can be any peace in a society reigned over by violence like this.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, a monopoly on violence is the foundation of order in every society.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even the Empress relied on the violence of the warriors to reign over this country.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I will not stand for your insult of Her Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"The president laughs off Hotori's sharp words.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The times have changed.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You don't have to show such deference to the Empress, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“She was just an ordinary person who happened to be born to a house called the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Not anyone particularly noble or talented at all.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Heheh... You might have a point there.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, you agree with me?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yes.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"The two smile sweetly at each other.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In other words, you're saying she's just like you, right?”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Someone made special only because of the status of her parents.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"The president freezes up.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Just kidding. That was just a joke.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh my, my, you certainly have a wonderful sense of humor for an Imperial.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll give you this steak here as a little treat.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks, but I think I'll pass. It does a real number on your skin, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehehee...”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ahahahaha...!”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"A terrifying exchange is unfolding right before me...",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, that's right. I have a question for you two.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"The president faces me and Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do you two know about the Exalt-Priestess?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"I explain the common knowledge of all Imperials.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"The Exalt-Priestess is the highest-ranking individual within the institution of the priesthood.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"They say only the priestess who meets the highest standards of character and talent at magicks is selected.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Right, right. In other words, the Exalt-Priestess is your religious leader.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But is that all?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"The president peers directly into my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"If I ignore the fact that she's a Republican, her limpid eyes are full of charm.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“She's the head of spellforce weapons development, isn't she?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've never interpreted it that way.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Just the other day, they chose a new Exalt-Priestess, even though the position has been vacant for three years.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's news to me.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh? Wait, have they not announced it yet?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, well.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'd love nothing more than to know how she makes those weapons.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What can a person like me do to extend an invitation to her? I'm not too familiar with Imperial etiquette, you see.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Going by etiquette, you shouldn't be able to meet her at all.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Her Eminence is a noble personage that only a select few people may seek an audience with.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, is that so? What a shame.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And here I was hoping I might be able to do things the Imperial way.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"The president stands up with her tray full of food.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well then, everybody, thank you very much for your time.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-san, I bid you a pleasant school life.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"The president leaves our table, her hair fluttering behind her.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Elsa, you'd better finish your broccoli!”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“L-Leave me alone!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I hate how lumpy it is!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What, you can't eat broccoli?”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, now...”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"The president's face flushes bright red.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I-If you'll excuse me!”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"The president scurries away with pattering footsteps.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Good grief. She's too obsessed with her work for her own good.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Seriously. Way to ruin our lunch break.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Akari and Shino slump their shoulders in tandem.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Looks like they'll get along well.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, watch yourself around the president.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll be fiiine.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Hotori glares at Akari as she waves her hand dismissively.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What?”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This only happened because you had to stand out in class.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But you wanna give them a piece of your mind too, don't you?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Get yourself killed if you want, but leave us out of it.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wha─”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Hotori stands up without a word.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hold it, Inou!”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Hotori ignores her and leaves.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"She must be pretty angry.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha! Republicans ain't got nothin' on how scary Imperials can be.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Was what I did really that bad?”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Akari doesn't know that the Sworn Blades are still active.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"And she'd never even dream that Hotori is our current acting chairman.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"I don't blame her for thinking she wasn't doing anything wrong.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I think your outspokenness is a good thing.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But I have to side with Hotori on this one.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If Elsa feels like it, she can even have you arrested without any due process.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And once you're arrested, it's all over, whether they actually have evidence or not.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And she can just get away with that?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're the ones that get to make all the rules. For now, at least.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Akari glares at me.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nothing. I'll be more careful from now on.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Still can't accept it?”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's head to our next class.”",
			},
		},
